{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\">\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-mismatched-end-tag.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-mismatched-end-tag.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":128,"endColumn":39,"endLine":3,"startColumn":38,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"/>"}}]}],"description":{"text":"self-close `<transition>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-mismatched-end-tag.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":10,"endLine":4,"startColumn":5,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"mismatched end tag: expected `</transition>`, found `</state>`\n\n**Note:** SCXML documents must be well-formed XML 1.0 with namespaces; no later validation runs until parsing succeeds\n\n**Help:** `<transition>` has no content, so end its start tag with `/>`\n\n**Spec:** XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents","text":"mismatched end tag: expected `</transition>`, found `</state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":139,"start":134},"category":"syntax"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"unclosed `<transition>` starts here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-mismatched-end-tag.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"XML001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML is an XML vocabulary; until the document parses, no schema or semantic rule can run"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: fix the XML syntax at the marked position: remove Markdown code fences or prose outside the single root element, keep `<?xml …?>` at the very start, escape `<` as `&lt;` and `&` as `&amp;` in attribute values and text (or use `<![CDATA[ … ]]>` in `<script>`), close or rename mismatched tags, quote attribute values, specify each attribute once, and never write `--` inside a comment.\n\nSpecification: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents\n\nRun `scx --explain XML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-well-formed","id":"XML001","name":"XML001","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the document is not well-formed XML"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}